'''Vela''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found at the forging station in [[Farnum's Farm]], located in the [[Southern Wilds]]. She sells [[Miner]] [[Jobs|Job]] related [[Items|items]] along with crafting supplies.

==Sells==
*[[Miner's Flair Shard of the Forest]]
*[[Miner's Flair Shard of Ice]]
*[[Miner's Power Shard of Timing I]]
*[[Miner's Necklace of Timing I]]
*[[Miner's Pickaxe of Timing I]]

==Trivia==
*Vela was introduced in-game on the update of October 15, 2013.
